{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class A819_v5 {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int a = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int b = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int l = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n        int r = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n        int total = a + b;\n        int cycles = 4;\n        int[] pattern = new int[total * cycles];\n        int offset = l / total;\n        l -= offset * total;\n        r -= offset * total;\n        int span = (r - l + 1) / total;\n        if (span > 2) {\n            r -= (span - 2) * total;\n        }\n        int diff = a > b ? a - b : 1;\n\n        // Precompute base pattern\n        for (int c = 0; c < cycles; c++) {\n            for (int k = 0; k < a - diff; k++) {\n                pattern[total * c + k] = k;\n            }\n            for (int k = 0; k < diff; k++) {\n                pattern[total * c + a - diff + k] = (c % 2 == 0) ? (a - diff + k) : (a + k);\n            }\n        }\n\n        int best = a + a;\n        int[] indices = new int[]{1, 1, 1, 1};\n        outerLoop:\n        while (true) {\n            // Apply current indices\n            for (int block = 0; block < 4; block++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j < b; j++) {\n                    pattern[total * block + a + j] = pattern[total * block + a - indices[block]];\n                }\n            }\n            best = Math.min(best, countDistinct(pattern, l, r));\n\n            // Increment indices\n            for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n                indices[i]++;\n                if (indices[i] <= diff) break;\n                indices[i] = 1;\n                if (i == 3) break outerLoop;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(best);\n    }\n\n    static int countDistinct(int[] colors, int left, int right) {\n        boolean[] seen = new boolean[24];\n        int distinct = 0;\n        for (int i = left; i <= right; i++) {\n            int color = colors[i];\n            if (!seen[color]) {\n                seen[color] = true;\n                distinct++;\n            }\n        }\n        return distinct;\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint countDistinct(const vector<int>& colors, int left, int right) {\n    vector<bool> seen(24, false);\n    int distinct = 0;\n    for (int i = left; i <= right; i++) {\n        int color = colors[i];\n        if (!seen[color]) {\n            seen[color] = true;\n            distinct++;\n        }\n    }\n    return distinct;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    vector<int> nums;\n    string current;\n    for (char c : line) {\n        if (c == ' ' || c == '\\t') {\n            if (!current.empty()) {\n                nums.push_back(stoi(current));\n                current.clear();\n            }\n        } else {\n            current += c;\n        }\n    }\n    if (!current.empty()) {\n        nums.push_back(stoi(current));\n    }\n    \n    int a = nums[0];\n    int b = nums[1];\n    int l = nums[2] - 1;\n    int r = nums[3] - 1;\n    int total = a + b;\n    int cycles = 4;\n    vector<int> pattern(total * cycles, 0);\n    int offset = l / total;\n    l -= offset * total;\n    r -= offset * total;\n    int span = (r - l + 1) / total;\n    if (span > 2) {\n        r -= (span - 2) * total;\n    }\n    int diff = a > b ? a - b : 1;\n\n    // Precompute base pattern\n    for (int c = 0; c < cycles; c++) {\n        for (int k = 0; k < a - diff; k++) {\n            pattern[total * c + k] = k;\n        }\n        for (int k = 0; k < diff; k++) {\n            pattern[total * c + a - diff + k] = (c % 2 == 0) ? (a - diff + k) : (a + k);\n        }\n    }\n\n    int best = a + a;\n    vector<int> indices = {1, 1, 1, 1};\n    \n    while (true) {\n        // Apply current indices\n        for (int block = 0; block < 4; block++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < b; j++) {\n                pattern[total * block + a + j] = pattern[total * block + a - indices[block]];\n            }\n        }\n        best = min(best, countDistinct(pattern, l, r));\n\n        // Increment indices\n        bool finished = false;\n        for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n            indices[i]++;\n            if (indices[i] <= diff) break;\n            indices[i] = 1;\n            if (i == 3) {\n                finished = true;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n        if (finished) break;\n    }\n    \n    cout << best << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00013302871957421303, -3.099436753473128e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00065662758424878